# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# ActivityPub search results with no single codebase of their own, so they get
# no grant record rather than an invented recipient:
#
#   ActivityPub-CommunityStewardship — FEP/SWICG facilitation and community
#     stewardship, no codebase.
#   Fediverse-TrustSafety — trust and safety service providers; the page has no
#     project summary yet.
#   ForgeFed-RPC — ForgeFed is a protocol and vocabulary; the grant implements
#     it in forges that already have their own records.
#   Solid-ActivityPub-Interop — bridge project; the page has no project summary
#     yet.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
